{% faqAccordion
   title="Frequently Asked Questions"
   titleAlign="left"
   allowMultiple=false %}
{% faqItem
   question="When does BOLD start?"
   answer="We having rolling admission for our 2026-2027 year through October 31st!" /%}

{% faqItem
   question="Will I have roomates?"
   answer="Yes! We want all BOLD participants to live in Christ-centered community together. There will be sleeping arrangements for guys and girls. (The cost of living is being sponsored for 2026-2027 participants)" /%}

{% anchorNavItem /%}

{% faqItem
   question="What if I'm in college?"
   answer="Students currently enrolled in classes can substitute their off-site work hours with online classes." /%}

{% faqItem
   question="Will someone help me find a church? Find a job?"
   answer="Yes! We can help you find a local church to attend and can help match you with a job that would be a great fit for you!" /%}

{% faqItem
   question="What will Spiritual Growth look like though the program?"
   answer="Every week, participants will engage weekly group bible study, foundational spiritual growth courses, and mentorship. " /%}

{% faqItem
   question="Will I be doing anything physical?"
   answer="We will have weekly programming involving adventure. Expect fun activities including kayaking, hiking, camping, etc.  " /%}

{% faqItem
   question="What does being on Camp Summer Staff look like?"
   answer="Through the program you will discover a skill you desire to develop and use it during Summer Camp as a paid Summer Staff. Summer Camp is full of worship and teaching, growth, and community!" /%}
{% /faqAccordion %}
